#2.What DNS name should the Blue application use to access the database redis-db-service in the dev namespace?
You can try it in the web application UI. Use port 6379.

Redis-db-service-dev-svc-cluster-local

Since the blue application and the redis-db-service are in different namespaces. In this case, we need to use the service name along with the namespace to access the database. The FQDN (fully Qualified Domain Name) for the redis-db-service in this example would be redis-db-service.dev.svc.cluster.local.

Note: You can also access it using the service name and namespace like this: redis-db-service.dev
